/path><path d="M4.80212 53.4204C-0.226751 46.2191 -0.914945 39.4026 0.94352 33.8017C2.7402 28.3873 6.79022 24.5044 10.5872 22.7037L13.3551 28.7322C11.0155 29.8418 8.31513 32.4034 7.14572 35.9276C6.03822 39.2655 6.29993 42.92 10.2712 48.6071L4.80212 53.4204Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M4.0817 58.8145C2.90389 55.8644 2.59012 52.7538 2.9424 50.0494C3.27679 47.4824 4.30947 44.6678 6.46532 43.0351L10.3282 48.5659C10.2259 48.6436 9.66817 49.302 9.45105 50.9686C9.25175 52.4986 9.4255 54.3837 10.1462 56.1889C11.4768 59.5216 14.8821 63.0841 22.6896 62.8994L22.8388 69.7367C12.5844 69.9794 6.54826 64.9924 4.0817 58.8145Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M16.0525 62.7684L22.6931 62.9073C22.6035 67.1531 23.7054 69.628 24.8853 70.9801C26.0717 72.3394 27.7073 72.9863 29.4804 72.9478C33.3441 72.8636 35.9426 69.8538 36.0693 66.2471L42.7218 65.7361C43.3144 74.6723 36.0677 79.9866 29.6147 80.127C26.2295 80.2006 22.6804 78.9401 20.024 75.8962C17.3611 72.8449 15.9338 68.3952 16.0525 62.7684Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></a><div data-v-8e54a55f="" class="aside-content"><span data-v-e2f44b48="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="transparent badge-container aside-badge ai-badge"><svg data-v-8e54a55f="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-3.5 h-3.5 ai-icon"><title>aiIcon</title><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg> AI-powered подготовка к сессии</span><h1 data-v-8e54a55f="" class="title">Готовься умнее, <br data-v-8e54a55f=""> <span data-v-8e54a55f="" class="title-highlight">сдавай лучше</span></h1><p data-v-8e54a55f="" class="description">Cogna помогает студентам учить билеты по науке о памяти — интервальное повторение, активное вспоминание и AI-проверка ответов.</p><ul data-v-03ba8fd7="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="features-list"><li data-v-a7857d27="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item"><span data-v-e2f44b48="" data-v-3c132480="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="transparent badge-container feature-list-badge feature-item-icon"><svg data-v-b5827be9="" data-v-8e54a55f="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open w-4 h-4 text-white icon"><title data-v-b5827be9="">book</title><path data-v-b5827be9="" d="M12 7v14"></path><path data-v-b5827be9="" d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path></svg></span><p data-v-e41df2f1="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item-title">Умные билеты</p><p data-v-0bd4f4db="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item-description">Создавай структурированные конспекты с формулами, схемами и таблицами</p></li><li data-v-a7857d27="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item"><span data-v-e2f44b48="" data-v-3c132480="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="transparent badge-container feature-list-badge feature-item-icon"><svg data-v-8e54a55f="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-brain w-4 h-4 text-white icon"><title>brain</title><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z"></path><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z"></path><path d="M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4"></path><path d="M17.599 6.5a3 3 0 0 0 .399-1.375"></path><path d="M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5"></path><path d="M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396"></path><path d="M19.938 10.5a4 4 0 0 1 .585.396"></path><path d="M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516"></path><path d="M19.967 17.484A4 4 0 0 1 18 18"></path></svg></span><p data-v-e41df2f1="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item-title">AI-проверка</p><p data-v-0bd4f4db="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item-description">Нейросеть анализирует твой ответ и указывает на пробелы</p></li><li data-v-a7857d27="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item"><span data-v-e2f44b48="" data-v-3c132480="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="transparent badge-container feature-list-badge feature-item-icon"><svg data-v-8e54a55f="" aria="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-4 h-4 text-white icon"><title>trending</title><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg></span><p data-v-e41df2f1="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item-title">Интервальное повторение</p><p data-v-0bd4f4db="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="feature-item-description">Алгоритм напоминает о билетах в момент, когда они начинают забываться</p></li></ul><span data-v-e2f44b48="" data-v-8e54a55f="" class="transparent badge-container aside-badge users-rating"><div data-v-8e54a55f="" data-slot="root" class="inline-flex flex-row-reverse justify-end users-list"><!--v-if--><span data-v-8e54a55f="" data-slot="root" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 select-none align-middle bg-elevated size-8 text-base relative rounded-full ring-bg first:me-0 ring-2 -me-1.5"><img src="https://github.com/noook.png" alt="Neil Richter" width="32" height="32" data-slot="image" class="h-full w-full rounded-[inherit] object-cover"></span><span data-v-8e54a55f="" data-slot="root" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 select-none align-middle bg-elevated size-8 text-base relative rounded-full ring-bg first:me-0 ring-2 -me-1.5"><img src="https://github.com/noook.png" alt="Neil Richter" width="32" height="32" data-slot="image" class="h-full w-full rounded-[inherit] object-cover"></span><span data-v-8e54a55f="" data-slot="root" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 select-none align-middle bg-elevated size-8 text-base relative rounded-full ring-bg first:me-0 ring-2 -me-1.5"><img src="https://github.com/romhml.png" alt="Romain Hamel" width="32" height="32" data-slot="image" class="h-full w-full rounded-[inherit] object-cover"></span><span data-v-8e54a55f="" data-slot="root" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 select-none align-middle bg-elevated size-8 text-base relative rounded-full ring-bg first:me-0 ring-2 -me-1.5"><img src="https://github.com/benjamincanac.png" alt="Benjamin Canac" width="32" height="32" data-slot="image" class="h-full w-full rounded-[inherit] object-cover"></span></div><p data-v-8e54a55f="" class="bold">12 000+ студентов</p><p data-v-8e54a55f="">уже готовятся с Cogna</p></span></div></aside>"`;
